{"id":"661434","name":"木耳肉条炒莲藕","author":"开心肥羊","authorId":"389860","desc":"","cover":"images/661434/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"莲藕","amount":"400g"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉条","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"肉条切片备用。","img":"images/661434/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"莲藕去皮，切薄片备用。","img":"images/661434/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"干木耳泡发，洗净备用。","img":"images/661434/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱洗净切段备用。","img":"images/661434/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中倒入适量油，下肉条煸炒一下。","img":"images/661434/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再把藕片、木耳、葱倒入，翻炒一下。","img":"images/661434/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入盐、鸡粉。","img":"images/661434/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒入胡椒粉。","img":"images/661434/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"然后滴入生抽，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/661434/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"最后倒入一碗清水，中火盖锅盖焖煮10分钟即可。","img":"images/661434/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}